<p>Yeah, this was&#8230; this was something new for me. Definitely an entertaining sort of writing project, though. Sly initially asked me to read over the draft and see if it could be saved, and I just really liked the dialogue in the interviews, and the image of an octopus sitting in a chair being a gracious host.</p>
